Mon Oct 26 11:14:25 UTC 2026 - Paolo Stivanin <info@paolostivanin.com>

- Update to 0.17.0 (upstream tag v0.17.0, 2026-10-25):
  * Harden importers and parsers with bounds on SVG raster surfaces,
    text layout and variable font metadata, PDF image samples and
    masks, frozen roto mattes, expression rewrite expansion and
    segmentation checkpoints; fix PDF CID width u32 overflows
  * Preview: keep rendering past cached frames after a loop,
    smarter disk-cache invalidation, zoom or resolution changes
    evict other sizes first
  * Layer: replace a source with Alt-drag, Reveal Layer Source in
    Project, layer switches act on the whole selection, New 3D
    Primitive dialog, Environment lights preserved
  * Text: Faux Bold, CJK fallback isolation, Range Selector counts
    with Units = Index
  * Colour effects (Tint, Tritone, Levels, Curves, Luma Key, Fill
    and others) now render as in After Effects; Gaussian and Fast
    Box Blur continuous at small values
  * Project and Composition Settings: Frame Count, Start at 0 or 1,
    Resolution menu with memory estimate
  * EPS: Illustrator EPS files draw their artwork
  * Interface: Georgian language, translations fall back to
    English, platform UI faces, languages sorted by own name
  * CLI: preserve template composition names when rendering
- Refresh the pinned release date in the metainfo stamp (2026-10-25)

