Fri Oct 23 07:15:47 UTC 2026 - Paolo Stivanin <info@paolostivanin.com>

- Update to 0.16.0 (upstream tag v0.16.0, 2026-10-23; via the
  untagged 0.12.0 version bump and v0.13.0, v0.14.0, v0.15.0):
  * Linux: the commands' file dialogs open through the desktop
    portal without blocking the frame; fonts honour
    FONTCONFIG_PATH; Microsoft font names resolve to installed
    metric-compatible fonts; variable-font named instances are
    styles of their family
  * Harden importers (no CVE assigned): glTF accessor spans and
    FBX memory budgets checked, SVG <use> expansion bounded with
    cycle detection, EPS/PDF huge arcs and long paths counted
    against import limits, precomp walks no longer recurse
  * Fix panics and overflows: ProEXR export with non-ASCII layer
    names, path rect with NaN sizes, sampleImage with huge
    sample points; script sockets get per-socket locks and a
    write deadline
  * CLI: render --progress reports frames on stderr when it is
    not a terminal; render --template --values fills media
    replacement controls with a file path
  * Compositing and editing: Accepts Shadows Only, Merge Paths,
    Mask Expansion, Wave Warp edge pinning, guide layers hidden
    in nested comps, Ease Presets on selected keyframes, preset
    drag-and-drop, comps reopen at their saved time, parametric
    shape paths convert to bezier, Range Selector viewer handles
  * Expressions: propertyGroup() and a group's propertyIndex;
    setValue rejects arrays of the wrong dimension
  * Interface: Japanese Settings dialog, localised layer and
    timeline context menus, mask point nudging with arrow keys
  * Docs and README reworded; SonarCloud fixes (HTTPS-only curl
    in upstream's package.sh, JS fixes in the web build)
  * Re-vendored (update=false, respect-lockfile=true): third-party
    crate set identical to 0.11.1 (620 crates, only workspace
    member versions changed in Cargo.lock), so the licence set is
    unchanged; cargo_vendor audit: all lockfiles audited, no
    RUSTSEC advisories
- effectcraft-no-brand-assets.patch applies unchanged (no fuzz or
  offset); 0.16.0 adds no new docs/brand references in code,
  build scripts or packaging
- Stamp the metainfo release date for v0.16.0 (2026-10-23)

