Sun Oct 18 17:25:40 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.11.1 (upstream tag v0.11.1, 2026-10-18):
  * Writes are atomic; relinking a moved project keeps Windows
    separators and UNC shares
  * Harden importers against crafted files (no CVE assigned):
    EPS idiv overflow, hostile ROI crop math, cyclic CFF seac
    recursion and non-Unicode CLI args no longer panic; PDF
    structure read through the shared parser
  * Import: AIFF renders; Composition Retain Layer Sizes for
    PDF/Illustrator; WebM last-frame duration; effects keep
    alpha with Blending Mode None; GPU Echo keeps preceding
    effects
  * Automation edits not duplicated after lost replies;
    media-browser and project listing performance
  * cargo_audit clean.
- Correct the License tag: BSD-2-Clause (arrayref),
  BSD-3-Clause (exr, lebe, tiny-skia), ISC (libloading),
  Unicode-3.0 (ICU) and Zlib (foldhash) were already linked
  in 0.10.0 but not declared; re-derived from the 0.11.1
  vendor tree with no other set change.

