Thu Oct 15 05:04:29 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.10.0 (stable tag v0.10.0, 2026-10-14,
  draft=false prerelease=false):
  * Harden importers against malicious files (no CVE assigned):
    PSD group nesting bound at 64, non-finite values dropped
    without panic, capped decode budget; SVG non-finite viewBox
    no longer panics; EPS huge angles no longer hang
  * PSD: damaged layer keeps merged image; memory budget for
    decodes and smart-object bakes
  * Render: Cryptomatte GPU path faster, capped frames in flight,
    resident effect stacks, GPU readback budgets
  * Scripting and expressions: layer.source, include/evalFile,
    footage proxies, keyframe and marker handling
  * Interface: Spanish and Japanese catalogs, portable mode,
    footage relink, unique comp names
  * Many more fixes and improvements; see upstream's release notes
    for the full list
- Re-vendored with update=false against the new Cargo.lock; audit
  clean, licence set unchanged
- effectcraft-no-brand-assets.patch still applies unchanged

