Sun Oct 11 06:58:19 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <martin@pluskal.org>

- Initial package 0.7.0: motion graphics and VFX compositor
  * Import: image sequences with Sequence option and Start
    Timecode; footage audio resampling no longer stutters
  * Plug-ins and extensions like After Effects: ScriptUI panels,
    Ease Presets panel, snapping options
  * Text: CJK fallback follows the interface language,
    Japanese vertical punctuation, Audio Spectrum rewritten
    to the linear model
  * Effects: Fractal Noise without lattice creases, EXtractoR for
    multi-layer EXRs, GPU Posterize parity, Puppet pin fix
  * Render Queue output names keep the format extension;
    export keeps values above 1.0 in EXR, writes 32-bit float
    AIFF-C correctly
  * Interface: Simplified/Traditional Chinese and Ukrainian
    translations, compact effect rows, long-press tool flyouts,
    MCP core tools with render progress and cancellation
  * Many more fixes and improvements; see upstream's release notes
    for the full list
- License is (Apache-2.0 OR MIT) AND MPL-2.0 AND OFL-1.1 AND
  Ubuntu-font-1.0: symphonia audio codecs are MPL-2.0, embedded
  fonts are OFL-1.1 and Ubuntu-font-1.0
- Add effectcraft-no-brand-assets.patch:
  docs/brand/ (ArtCraft marks) is not open source, so exclude it
  from the tarball and show the open-source app tile in the
  header bar and About dialog instead
- No cargo test in %check: the GPU suite needs a GL device absent
  from the build root; upstream CI runs cargo test --workspace
- Split out effectcraft-cli subpackage: headless renderer, batch
  runner and command server moves to its own package; main package
  Recommends it

